[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525066615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100138#issuecomment-2525066615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100138","id":2525066615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WgXV3","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-07T10:39:04Z","updated_at":"2024-12-07T10:39:04Z","body":"A bit unrelated, sorry, but still worth pointing out imo since people with knowledge about the bicubic lightmap filtering will have a look: the Vulkan one has some light leaking while the DX12 does not. Not sure if it's due to the filtering or some bug/unwanted behaviour.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525066615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525099118","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100138#issuecomment-2525099118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100138","id":2525099118,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WgfRu","user":{"login":"StaydMcMuffin","id":38304659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzA0NjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38304659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin","html_url":"https://github.com/StaydMcMuffin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-07T12:33:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-07T12:33:28Z","body":"> A bit unrelated, sorry, but still worth pointing out imo since people with knowledge about the bicubic lightmap filtering will have a look: the Vulkan one has some light leaking while the DX12 does not. Not sure if it's due to the filtering or some bug/unwanted behaviour.\n\nThat's just due to the bicubic filtering. This scene is very simplistic, just a bunch of cubes I slapped together, so there's a bit of floor geometry inside the walls, the pixels of which leak outside the wall due to bicubic's wider footprint. I'm actually considering making a pull request to address this automatically during baking by detecting when one surface is inside another, but until then it's nothing to worry about.","author_associa